{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28}},"0e251b88-4eb5-4301-a7a7-103b1d9dcf67":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"3f6d6559-e4d9-4af5-87c7-4c69c6ac697c":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<p>Showcase your home with beautiful blooms<\/p>","heading_size":"h0"}},"template--16069965643955__0e251b88-4eb5-4301-a7a7-103b1d9dcf67-1669171418d05e9099-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>No garden. No problem.<\/p><p>Create the perfect indoor garden for your home or office with stunning seasonal blooms.<\/p><p>Flowers that welcome, accessorise and add the wow factor.<\/p><p>Can’t decide?<a href=\"\/pages\/contact-us\" title=\"CONTACT\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Email or call me 021 2347844   <\/span><\/a>to discuss your flower needs.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p>*All images are indicative only. So you get the most beautiful blooms, I use what’s looking great and in season. That means the images you see of the arrangements are only an indication of the colours and flowers included.<\/p><p><\/p>"}},"template--16069965643955__0e251b88-4eb5-4301-a7a7-103b1d9dcf67-1669171418d05e9099-2":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}}},"block_order":["3f6d6559-e4d9-4af5-87c7-4c69c6ac697c","template--16069965643955__0e251b88-4eb5-4301-a7a7-103b1d9dcf67-1669171418d05e9099-1","template--16069965643955__0e251b88-4eb5-4301-a7a7-103b1d9dcf67-1669171418d05e9099-2"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02":{"type":"image-banner","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02-1668912068af3088a4-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Mel’s Flower Truck","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--15859280478387__c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02-1668912068af3088a4-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"Buy Flowers In St John’s Or Online.        Delivery Auckland-Wide","text_style":"body"}},"template--15859280478387__c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02-1668912068af3088a4-2":{"type":"buttons","settings":{"button_label_1":"SHOP NOW","button_link_1":"","button_style_secondary_1":false,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02-1668912068af3088a4-0","template--15859280478387__c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02-1668912068af3088a4-1","template--15859280478387__c9ee904b-6192-4ba3-a44b-ffd105d23d02-1668912068af3088a4-2"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/mels-flower-truck-home.jpg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"medium","adapt_height_first_image":false,"desktop_content_position":"middle-center","show_text_box":true,"desktop_content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"center","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"show_text_below":true}},"912a4554-b521-442c-a251-58ff7a8a79c7":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__912a4554-b521-442c-a251-58ff7a8a79c7-16689122917122b8e5-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<p>Flowers Bring The Joy To Your Day<\/p>","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--15859280478387__912a4554-b521-442c-a251-58ff7a8a79c7-16689122917122b8e5-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Everyone deserves to enjoy flowers. <\/p><p>Flowers captivate all our senses. <\/p><p>They look wonderful and smell amazing, and we can’t help but reach out and feel the delicate blooms. <\/p><p>Giving, receiving and being around flowers lift our spirits and make us feel special. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__912a4554-b521-442c-a251-58ff7a8a79c7-16689122917122b8e5-0","template--15859280478387__912a4554-b521-442c-a251-58ff7a8a79c7-16689122917122b8e5-1"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"3749ef09-8d72-4248-89ad-730dbf87777f":{"type":"image-with-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__3749ef09-8d72-4248-89ad-730dbf87777f-1668911698b49c5cb3-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--15859280478387__3749ef09-8d72-4248-89ad-730dbf87777f-1668911698b49c5cb3-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>I noticed that people were avoiding buying flowers because they didn’t see the value in buying an arrangement that faded and dropped after a couple of days. <\/p><p>So I use my years of knowledge in the flower industry to select blooms in combinations that last. <\/p><p>And put them together in beautiful arrangements that give the wow factor to your gift, home, office or event. <\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__3749ef09-8d72-4248-89ad-730dbf87777f-1668911698b49c5cb3-0","template--15859280478387__3749ef09-8d72-4248-89ad-730dbf87777f-1668911698b49c5cb3-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/d3563cbf-2a5a-4b2d-b61e-bce56b2e78e3.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3-166891237475173de6-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<p>Beautiful, Easy To Order Flowers<\/p>","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--15859280478387__caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3-166891237475173de6-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>- Market-Fresh.<\/strong> All our flowers are bought fresh every 2-3 days, so you get the longest-lasting, stunning flowers<\/p><p><strong>- 19+ years of flower-buying experience. <\/strong>Arranging flowers is one skill, but knowing how to buy the right blooms takes different knowledge. With over 19 years of experience, I know which flowers to buy to get the best value and the biggest wow factor for your arrangement. <\/p><p><strong>- Local to Auckland Eastern Bays. <\/strong>Being local means you can come and find me from Monday to Friday at 69A Merton Road, St John’s. And I can deliver easily around Remuera, Stonefields, Meadowbank and Ellerslie. <\/p><p><strong>- Totally obsessed with flowers. <\/strong>If you can’t decide or need advice on your flower choices, let’s talk. Come down to Mel’s Flower Truck, or email me with your questions. I can help you get the perfect flowers for any occasion.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3-166891237475173de6-0","template--15859280478387__caae1821-be14-42f5-bb46-4c48de80e0a3-166891237475173de6-1"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6":{"type":"multicolumn","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6-16689125564a2ef853-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/logo.png","title":"Auckland Netball","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--15859280478387__3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6-16689125564a2ef853-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/download.jpg","title":"Axis sports medicine","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--15859280478387__3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6-16689125564a2ef853-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Logo_on_BG_texture.jpg","title":"Barfoot & Thompson","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}},"2f40dfaf-4682-46fb-999c-67c947f67424":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/download.png","title":"Meadowbank Oceania Health care","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6-16689125564a2ef853-0","template--15859280478387__3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6-16689125564a2ef853-1","template--15859280478387__3d2b83f0-b6d9-449f-ad4c-369961c573c6-16689125564a2ef853-2","2f40dfaf-4682-46fb-999c-67c947f67424"],"settings":{"title":" Bringing The Floral Wow Factor To Auckland","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":4,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"074fb401-30d6-4c69-84b9-3d08885dabd1":{"type":"image-banner","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__074fb401-30d6-4c69-84b9-3d08885dabd1-1668964240d6b9e529-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"I Believe The Best Flowers In Auckland Should Be","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--15859280478387__074fb401-30d6-4c69-84b9-3d08885dabd1-1668964240d6b9e529-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"Stunning Seasonal Sustainable","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__074fb401-30d6-4c69-84b9-3d08885dabd1-1668964240d6b9e529-0","template--15859280478387__074fb401-30d6-4c69-84b9-3d08885dabd1-1668964240d6b9e529-1"],"settings":{"image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"medium","adapt_height_first_image":false,"desktop_content_position":"middle-center","show_text_box":true,"desktop_content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"center","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"show_text_below":true}},"b404626b-4b3e-48e9-b52b-067e7e7fa468":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__b404626b-4b3e-48e9-b52b-067e7e7fa468-166896435187fc4bb7-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Such a fantastic option! Gorgeous bouquet with tailor-made details, easy pickup around the community, very competitive price, and of course, nice Mel, the owner. Be sure to come back again.<\/p><p>~ Dan<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__b404626b-4b3e-48e9-b52b-067e7e7fa468-166896435187fc4bb7-1"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6":{"type":"collapsible-content","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-0":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"WHAT’S SO GOOD ABOUT MARKET FRESH FLOWERS?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Many florists or supermarkets hold onto flowers. So when you buy them, they’re already a few days old. Market-fresh flowers are the freshest and last the longest. I aim to sell all my flowers within 2 days of getting them from the market. So you can be sure your flowers last as long as possible. <\/p>","page":""}},"template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"HOW LONG SHOULD FLOWERS LAST?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>This can vary from variety to variety. I strive to sell Market fresh flowers, which is why I sell out - I don’t hold stock.<\/p><p>When putting together my bouquets I always try and include different elements that make the arrangement last. You should be able to get 7-10 days out of the lasting aspect. <\/p><p>If you’re unsure of what to order and how long it will last, don’t hesitate to ask,<\/p><p>and I can talk you through the options<\/p>","page":""}},"template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-2":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"HOW CAN I HELP MY FLOWERS LAST LONGER?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Not all flowers will last the same amount of time, so it’s crucial that you change the water and remove any flowers that have past their best to ensure the others will last.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"DO YOU DELIVER FLOWERS?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Yes, I do flower deliveries Auckland Wide Monday – Friday and Saturday on Request. I use dedicated floral couriers that I know and trust. <\/p><p>When you order, please make sure you give your phone number so the delivery company can contact the recipient in case of delivery problems. <\/p><p>And double check the delivery details, giving information on access to the property. If we can’t access the property your flowers might not be able to be delivered and we will still charge for this. <\/p>","page":""}},"11e1cdc8-0e97-4dbf-be58-535cca6d5463":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"HOW ARE YOUR FLOWERS SO AFFORDABLE?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>At Mel’s Flower truck, I’m well-practised in buying from the flower markets, having done so for the past 17 years. What I have come to realise is that people have been led to believe that flowers are unaffordable.<\/p><p>Sure there are some amazing flowers that are “On Trend”, and these have the price tag to match. I often look at these flowers at the market in awe as well. They have their place for weddings and events, but (for example) I’m not going to sell a single white hydrangea for $20.00. It’s just not in my ethos.<\/p><p>I purchase what is in season and best value. If there’s lots of it at the truck it<\/p><p>means it's good value. Unless it’s the middle of winter when prices always go up purely because it's hard to grow in winter. If you take note (there’s nothing in anyone’s gardens either)<\/p><p>Having a mobile flower truck also allows me to keep my overheads down, and I’ll be there in all weather to keep flowers affordable for you.<\/p><p>I also wrap in brown paper to keep costs down; at the end of the day, it’s the<\/p><p>flowers that should be the focus, not the wrap, as it often goes straight in the bin. I want all people to be able to enjoy flowers and not have to spend a fortune.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-0","template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-1","template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-2","template--15859280478387__3afb8809-5b92-4dd1-863f-d3519f4ac0c6-16689643514e6d5092-3","11e1cdc8-0e97-4dbf-be58-535cca6d5463"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"What’s So Special About Market Fresh Flowers, And Other Questions You Might Have","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"background-1","container_color_scheme":"background-2","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76":{"type":"multicolumn","disabled":true,"blocks":{"template--15859280478387__6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76-16689125564a2ef853-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_2109.jpg","title":"Flowers For Delivery","text":"<p>Order flowers for birthdays, thank you, celebrations and anniversaries.<\/p><p>SHOP NOW →<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--15859280478387__6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76-16689125564a2ef853-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"Flowers For Your Home or Office","text":"<p>Bring the outside in and showcase your home or office with beautiful seasonal blooms.  <\/p><p>SHOP NOW →<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--15859280478387__6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76-16689125564a2ef853-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/H_A-186_websize.jpg","title":"Flowers For Your Event","text":"<p>Create the wow factor without words for your event, party <\/p><p>or birthday.<\/p><p>LET’S TALK →<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--15859280478387__6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76-16689125564a2ef853-0","template--15859280478387__6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76-16689125564a2ef853-1","template--15859280478387__6d38f711-a81f-46ec-8606-c93081113b76-16689125564a2ef853-2"],"settings":{"title":"Stunning, Lasting, Market-Fresh Flowers","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":3,"column_alignment":"center","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"template--16069965643955__d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3-1669177743eb9fa1e6-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/FullSizeRender_1.jpg","title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}},"c8d6a594-7a72-48df-a735-7d47f738b68e":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_3747.jpg","title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--16069965643955__d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3-1669177743eb9fa1e6-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_3733.jpg","title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--16069965643955__d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3-1669177743eb9fa1e6-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--16069965643955__d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3-1669177743eb9fa1e6-0","c8d6a594-7a72-48df-a735-7d47f738b68e","template--16069965643955__d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3-1669177743eb9fa1e6-1","template--16069965643955__d700db4a-2845-4006-a7c5-cf0672bf2aa3-1669177743eb9fa1e6-2"],"settings":{"title":"","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"portrait